OL,4,W-,,%-,,%-,,% ,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,$
OL,6, Rhodesian commandos have infiltrated
OL,7, neighbouring Zambia and attacked
OL,8, buildings used by nationalist
OL,9, guerrillas in the capital, Lusaka.
OL,11,BThe home of nationalist leader Joshua
OL,12,BNkomo was burned down after a fierce
OL,13,Bgun battle, but Mr Nkomo was not there
OL,14,Bat the time.
OL,16,BOther commando targets included the
OL,17,Bbuilding where Mr Nkomo has his
OL,18,Bheadquarters.
OL,20,BSome casualties have been reported
OL,21,Bbut numbers are not known.
OL,23,C  FromG13-04-79C/ teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
