OL,6, Uganda's new President, Mr Yusufu Lule,
OL,7, has appealed for unity and urged his
OL,8, supporters not to seek vengeance in a
OL,9, speech after his swearing in at Kampala
OL,11,BBut some Kampala residents have said
OL,12,Bthat Tanzanian troops have been killing
OL,13,Bsurvivors of the deposed President
OL,14,BAmin's army in cold blood.
OL,16,BAt the swearing in ceremony Mr Lule
OL,17,Balso called for two minutes silence for
OL,18,Bthe estimated half-million Ugandans
OL,19,Bkilled by the Amin regime. Commando
OL,20,Bsquads are now searching for Amin in
OL,21,Bthe east of the country - the new
OL,22,Bregime wants to bring him to trial on
OL,23,Bcharges of mass murder.  CFromG13-04-79
