OL,4,W-,,%-,,%-,,% ,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,$
OL,6, The man found dead on Snowdon has been
OL,7, named as Mr John Mountain, of Thorpe
OL,8, Bay, Essex.
OL,10,FHe was found after a search by dogs and
OL,11,Fan RAF helicopter, and had fallen about
OL,12,F5OO feet.
OL,14,FThe man and his 12-year-old daughter,
OL,15,FAllison, had been found exhausted last
OL,16,Fnight by a walker who dug a snow-hole,
OL,17,Fwhere he left them while he went for
OL,18,Fhelp. Rescuers found the girl asleep
OL,19,Fand the father missing.
OL,21,FThe girl is in hospital suffering from
OL,22,Fexposure.
OL,23,                          CFromG13-04-79
