OL,6, Easter Monday sports programmes on
OL,7, BBC tv are threatened by a 24-hour
OL,8, strike by outside broadcast engineers.
OL,10,FTheir union, the Association of
OL,11,FBroadcasting Staff, is havang talks
OL,12,Fin London with the BBC and officials
OL,13,Fof the Advisory Conciliation and
OL,14,FArbitration Service.
OL,16,FThe dispute is over the back-dating
OL,17,Fof a grading offer.
OL,19,FArriving for the meeting, ABS general
OL,20,Fsecretary Mr Tony Hearne said he
OL,21,Fthought it would be "very difficult"
OL,22,Fto reach a settlement.
OL,23,                          CFromG13-04-79
